iddle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 50% of normal in September to October and 43% in October to November. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 224% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, from 60% on grid 29865 to 66% on grid 30165.</p>"}
